  "title": "Redux Payments vs FlyCode: Rule-Based Retries vs a Recovery Platform",
  "summary": "Redux and FlyCode both recover failed payments on Stripe, but they are different categories. Redux is a rule-based retry layer that adds attempts on top of Stripe, which can lower your authorization rate. FlyCode is a full recovery platform: adaptive per-merchant retries, backup cards, outreach, revenue agents, and Slack, across Stripe, Shopify, Recharge, Skio, and Chargebee, powered with partnerships with Visa, Mastercard, Stripe, and Shopify.",
